<title>SINGAPORE: Metro 1996/97 net profit soars.</title>
<headline>Metro 1996/97 net profit soars.</headline>
<dateline>SINGAPORE 1997-06-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>		   (in millions of S$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net profit			     11.90 vs   1.08</p>
<p>    Dividend (percent)		    6.00 vs   5.00</p>
<p>    Group shr (cents)		    11.31 vs   1.03</p>
<p>    Turnover				248.31 vs 223.85</p>
<p>    Other income incl. interest	 0.22 vs   0.60</p>
<p>    Interest (expense)		    8.20 vs   7.48</p>
<p>    Depreciation/amortisation	   4.03 vs   5.68</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 20.16 vs  10.36</p>
<p>    Loss from associates		  1.43 vs   6.69</p>
<p>    Tax					 6.88 vs   2.56</p>
<p>    Minorities		     (gain) 0.05 vs   0.03 (loss)</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries		(gain) 2.51 vs  24.78 (loss)</p>
<p>Note - Metro Holdings Ltd runs a chain of department stores.</p>
<p>-- Singapore newsroom (65 8703199)</p>
</text>
